#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-landingpage.rst:7
#: 5af751982eb14cac9bbb07db1f6f74a4
msgid ""
"Copter/Plane/Rover support a number of different rangefinders including "
"Lidars (which use lasers or infra-red beams for distance measurements), 360 "
"degree Lidars (which can detect obstacles in multiple directions) and Sonars"
" (which use ultrasonic sound). This category also includes Maxbotix Sonar "
"and Pulsed Light LED range finders. These devices can be used for measuring "
"distance near to  the ground for precision landings and altitude control, "
"water depth, or object distance as proximity sensors for :ref:`Object "
"Avoidance<common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`. Vision systems (see "
":ref:`common-realsense-depth-camera`) can also be used for Object Avoidance."
msgstr ""
"Copter/Plane/Rover 支持多种测距仪，包括激光雷达（使用激光或红外光测距）、360 "
"度激光雷达（可探测多方向障碍物）和声呐（使用超声波）。此类别还涵盖 Maxbotix 声呐和脉冲光 LED "
"测距仪。这些设备可用于精准降落及高度控制时测量近地距离、水深，或作为近距传感器用于 :ref:`避障<common-object-avoidance-"
"landing-page>` 。视觉系统（参见 :ref:`common-realsense-depth-camera`）也可用于避障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-landingpage.rst:9
#: 589f621fa8b94f2db591cf64eb7d1982
msgid ""
"A forward facing rangefinders can also be used for Obstacle Avoidance. See "
"Rangefinder :ref:`Setup Overview <common-rangefinder-setup>` to know more."
msgstr "前向测距仪也可用于避障。请参阅测距仪 :ref:`设置概览 <common-rangefinder-setup>` 了解更多信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-landingpage.rst:16
#: 729459366ce742fc90ed61058ad8b86f
msgid ""
"Downward facing rangefinders are automatically used in flight modes which "
"have height control, such as Altitude Hold, Loiter and PosHold Mode.  The "
"data from the sensor will be used until you exceed ``RNGFNDx_MAX``, after "
"that it switches to the barometer."
msgstr ""
"向下测距仪可在具备高度控制的飞行模式（如 Altitude Hold、Loiter 和 PosHold 模式）中自动使用。传感器数据将持续使用，直到超过"
" ``RNGFNDx_MAX`` 为止，之后切换至气压计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-landingpage.rst:21
#: 4d0b9d1cd387464090e28150439d9212
msgid ""
"Copter includes support for :ref:`Terrain Following <terrain-following>` in "
"Auto mode."
msgstr "Copter 在 Auto 模式下支持 :ref:`地形跟随 <terrain-following>` 。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-landingpage.rst:23
#: 5112b45c85ea4aa3855a3fb5c2e13f24
msgid ""
"Copter can also use rangefinders for :ref:`Object Avoidance <common-object-"
"avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr "Copter 还可使用测距仪进行 :ref:`避障 <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` 。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-landingpage.rst:29
#: ce90b35e35944e5eb86f07280be95fde
msgid ""
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` must be set to a tested, appropriate value.  If "
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` is set to a value greater than the range of the sensor, the "
"autopilot will not respond correctly to the data provided."
msgstr ""
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` 必须设置为经过测试的合适值。若 ``RNGFNDx_MAX`` "
"设置为超出传感器量程的值，飞控将无法正确响应所提供的数据。"

